            "pk": "17893374717325202",
            "text": "🚀 Digital Startups Scale Up Program: Shanghai\n\nAstana Hub and IT Park Uzbekistan, within the framework of the joint Central Asian Innovation Hubs initiative, together with Khan Tengri Innovation Hub, are launching the selection of 4 startups from Kazakhstan and 4 startups from Uzbekistan to join the Digital Startups Scale Up Program!\n\n🌏 Step into the world’s largest market — immerse yourself in China’s innovation ecosystem, test your product, connect with partners and investors, and scale globally.\n\n✨ What’s in store for you:\n• 2-month offline program in Shanghai — October 20 to December 14, 2025\n• Only 8 selected startups from Kazakhstan and Uzbekistan\n• Co-living & Co-working — accommodation and workspace included\n• Masterclasses, mentorship, meetings with investors and corporations\n• Final Demo Day with Chinese partners\n\n💰 Participation terms:\n• Fee — $5,000 per participant (accommodation included)\n• Flights, visa, and personal expenses are covered by participants\n• Venue — Kehai Building, Pudong, Shanghai\n\n📩 Submit your application by September 22 via the link in the profile description, under the «Programs» section.\n\n📞 For additional questions:\nMaral Shashkenova — Partner, Khan Tengri Innovation Hub and Growth Vision Pro: maral@growthvision.pro"
        },
